<p>
This code uses this server <a href="https://sachachua.com/blog/2026/10/using-emacs-to-visualize-speaking-and-target-words-phrases-in-real-ish-time/asr.py">vad-file.py</a>, which I generated with Google Gemini. It emits JSONL for voice activity detection events (start/stop) and uses Orukeet to transcribe the speech once the voice activity detection notices it's finished. I also use spacy to look up token information because I want to someday colour the nouns by gender, which might allow me to correct myself in the next sentence instead of hesitating in the previous one.
</p>


